{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements.\n\nThe user's interest is: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Explicitly NOT interested in equipment promotions (器材促销) or photographer's private life (摄影师私生活).\n\nI need to select exactly 20 distinct candidates from the working set of 80 exposed candidates.\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. Each candidate has a title pattern like \"主题：场景中的内容类型\". The content types are:\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - these are about camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements - this is 器材促销/equipment promotion content which the user explicitly does NOT want.\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - about photography exhibitions, curator clues, author biographies, artwork circulation - this is about photographer's life/art history, which relates to 摄影师私生活/art background.\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - explains from light, imaging, visual relationships - this matches the user's interest in 成像原理 (imaging principles) and 不同条件下的调整.\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - lists common concepts - matches learning.\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - fixed composition and light, changes parameters, records images - matches 实际拍摄方法 (actual shooting methods).\n\nThe user's interest explicitly says: 关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活。\n\nSo the user wants content about:\n- 实际拍摄方法 (actual shooting methods) → 操作记录\n- 成像原理 (imaging principles) → 条件与原理\n- 不同条件下的调整 (adjustments under different conditions) → 条件与原理, 操作记录\n\nAnd does NOT want:\n- 器材促销 (equipment promotion) → 市场观察\n- 摄影师私生活 (photographer's private life) → 专题观察 (which discusses author biographies, artwork circulation, art history)\n\nSo the best candidates are those with content type 条件与原理 and 操作记录. These directly match the user's stated interest.\n\nLet me identify all candidates with these content types.\n\n